&lt;code&gt;arrayref&lt;/code&gt;, which was downloaded 2,285 times before being removed; see
&lt;a href=&quot;https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0260.html&quot;&gt;the &lt;code&gt;arrayref&lt;/code&gt; advisory&lt;/a&gt; for more detail.&lt;/p&gt;


