        &lt;span class=&quot;floating-menu&quot;&gt;
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/commits/main/crates/tinymember/RUSTSEC-2026-0263.md&quot;&gt;History&lt;/a&gt; ⋅
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db/edit/main/crates/tinymember/RUSTSEC-2026-0263.md&quot;&gt;Edit&lt;/a&gt; ⋅
          &lt;a href=&quot;https://api.osv.dev/v1/vulns/RUSTSEC-2026-0263&quot;&gt;JSON (OSV)&lt;/a&gt;
        &lt;/span&gt;
    

    &lt;header&gt;
      &lt;h1&gt;
        
        RUSTSEC-2026-0263
        
      &lt;/h1&gt;
      &lt;span class=&quot;subtitle&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;tinymember&lt;/code&gt; was removed from crates.io due to affiliation with malicious code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;

    

    &lt;dl&gt;
      &lt;dt id=&quot;reported&quot;&gt;Reported&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-08-20&quot;&gt;
          August 20, 2026
        &lt;/time&gt;
      &lt;/dd&gt;

      &lt;dt id=&quot;issued&quot;&gt;Issued&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        &lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-08-20&quot;&gt;
          August 20, 2026
        &lt;/time&gt;
        
      &lt;/dd&gt;

      &lt;dt id=&quot;package&quot;&gt;Package&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        
        
        &lt;a href=&quot;/packages/tinymember.html&quot;&gt;tinymember&lt;/a&gt;
          
        
        
      &lt;/dd&gt;

      &lt;dt id=&quot;type&quot;&gt;Type&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        
        Vulnerability
        
      &lt;/dd&gt;

      

      

      

      
      &lt;dt id=&quot;details&quot;&gt;References&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
        
          &lt;li&gt;
            &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.rust-lang.org/2026/08/20/supply-chain-attack-on-arrayref&quot;&gt;
              https://blog.rust-lang.org/2026/08/20/supply-chain-attack-on-arrayref
            &lt;/a&gt;
          &lt;/li&gt;
        
        
        &lt;/ul&gt;
      &lt;/dd&gt;
      

      

      
      

      &lt;dt id=&quot;patched&quot;&gt;Patched&lt;/dt&gt;
      &lt;dd&gt;
        
        no patched versions
        
      &lt;/dd&gt;

      

      
      
    &lt;/dl&gt;

    
    

    &lt;h3 id=&quot;description&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;While &lt;code&gt;tinymember&lt;/code&gt; did not directly contain malicious code, it was owned by the
same user as &lt;code&gt;arone&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;aronenao&lt;/code&gt;, which contained suspicious build scripts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This crate had 2 versions published on 2026-08-18 that had a total of 27 downloads.
